================================================================================

This distribution contains source code, configuration files, monitoring definitions, and documentation developed for the Intel Full System Monitoring project. It includes Docker Compose deployment assets, Prometheus scrape configuration, Grafana dashboards, xpumd settings, and supporting files for collecting GPU, CPU, and vLLM telemetry on Intel XPU hosts.

The project may reference third-party software, libraries, tools, models, and container images, including Intel XPU tooling, Prometheus, Grafana, and vLLM. These components are not included or redistributed as part of this repository and must be obtained separately from their respective upstream sources, subject to their own license terms.

